    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever had any "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "crazy",
            "ref": "v-crazy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " dreams? Kerry Haulotte, a 64-year-old man from Chicago, U.S.A., has just "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " one such dream."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Three years ago, Haulotte started a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " project—building a special floating suit "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "漂浮服"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " hundreds of hours making the suit out of 1,150 wine corks "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "葡萄酒的软木塞"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Recently, Haulotte finished his suit. He took the 6-kilogram suit out on a boat trip on a lake. The man "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the suit and jumped into the lake. Just as he had hoped, he was able to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "successfully",
            "ref": "v-successfully"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the water!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Since then, Haulotte has often worn the cork suit to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the water. He also likes to let others "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Everyone who floats in the suit signs and dates it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“I was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that people would think I was crazy,” said Haulotte. “But "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " they really like it.” His interesting suit has brought "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to many passers-by. And of course, many have also had fun floating in it!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
